;; BIND zone file for importing lionreader.com into Cloudflare.
;; Generated from the live Route53 zone export: 16 record sets in, 7 lines out.
;; Verified to round-trip against the export: every one of the 20 record values
;; is accounted for exactly once — 7 here, 7 owned by Terraform, 6 excluded.
;;
;; DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED — do not add these by hand:
;;   SOA / NS   Cloudflare manages these for the zone.
;;   A / AAAA / CNAME records — owned by Terraform (cloudflare.tf), because
;;              those are the proxyable types where `proxied = false` is an
;;              invariant we want enforced in code. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
;;   _acme-challenge.lionreader.com.lionreader.com. — a doubled name from an
;;              FQDN pasted into a field that already appends the zone. The
;;              correctly-named record never existed and nothing queries this
;;              one; Fly proves ownership via the apex AAAA instead. Dropped.
;;
;; Everything here is TXT or MX: types Cloudflare cannot proxy, so there is no
;; grey-cloud decision to get wrong. Mail config, owned in the dashboard.

$ORIGIN lionreader.com.

lionreader.com.                   	300	IN	TXT	"google-site-verification=VaZJWXsqI7zVXMOAPZnWO1gqc7vbMTwUEyaqjhd-Js8"
_discord.lionreader.com.          	3600	IN	TXT	"dh=a1c8abb6b4d9e85506d748e1ef7331dcbb5232ac"
app.lionreader.com.               	300	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 include:mailgun.org ~all"
_dmarc.app.lionreader.com.        	300	IN	TXT	"v=DMARC1; p=none; pct=100; fo=1; ri=3600; rua=mailto:c7650f54@dmarc.mailgun.org,mailto:eb182582@inbox.ondmarc.com; ruf=mailto:c7650f54@dmarc.mailgun.org,mailto:eb182582@inbox.ondmarc.com;"
krs._domainkey.app.lionreader.com.	300	IN	TXT	"k=rsa; p=MIGfMA0GCSqGSIb3DQEBAQUAA4GNADCBiQKBgQDwjmL/6JMMVYdLu30HDMoAe/tt75hwN20W5bS6eRBUoEMwBIPPilwA+G8PzWDeMHUkAjzBhuDk0S2g8NVC/PqaU5oFRbPVmU0REq75ZyraAyUfPVDT6j/asvnA4LyJzqBWaAt183AK4VtOpS3KNr8VyI5jzyFbVDO6IAzMj8zF2wIDAQAB"
in.app.lionreader.com.            	86400	IN	MX	10 mxa.mailgun.org
in.app.lionreader.com.            	86400	IN	MX	10 mxb.mailgun.org
